            - Post-feedback
                - MC
                    - "Hmmm. Do not like the power cut-in closing history. I think it’s fine to minimize it for the animation but I’d prefer that it opens up again once it’s done."
                        - Working for using mind reading/mind wiping but when we do call screen psychic_powers or display choices it also forgets it afterwards

                    - "Distinct UI element for next line/dialogue, remove history log from the navigation entirely and make it up/down controls it, up/down has no other navigation use for the other elements when and only when history is visible. Left/right on Hide/Reread loops to powers. And make it so history retains open state after a power."
                    - "You do not appear to be able to scroll up/down in the history during a decision point"
                    - "Hmmm, something on the UX for buttons is throwing me off when you have a locked one. It’s not always clear which you have selected since locked is always fully black background. And when it’s 1 unlocked option (hovered) and X locked options it’s not clear that any is selected at all."
                    - "Oh wait I just navigated into the history there. Right so it’s… navigate off one of the other options, have no visual indicator that the history log is selected except for the fact that no other option is selected, press the primary button to focus it and then you can go up and down. Requiring to to press the primary button again to unselect it and return to real options. That is… not especially intuitive my dude."
                    - "Also if you go to “read mind” and then press down you now have the history log highlighted. Pressing down again does nothing because it’s not selected but also does nothing because there is no down to go to. Same for right off one of the options."
                - Serena
                    - "The logo is difficult to read against the busy background. Is there a way to bring it forward? (Maybe a white/yellow outline around the black lettering?)"
                    - "Can you include a DEFAULT button so all the settings reset?"
                    - "The yellow-on-yellow is a little tricky to read:" (for displaying mind-read thoughts in the history)
                    - "Should LOCKED be a different colour (or look different) to the selected option? At the moment, they look very similar:"
                    - "BTW - now that I’ve done some rewinds - it might be nice for the history to clear whenever I rewind, because that just cleans things up and makes the history easier to follow."
                    - "Potentially - could add a slight pause just before the CG for the gunshot? To show the impact"
                    - "I got a random S to the right of the screen going on." (the dollar sign for cash money in the pause menu)
