                    - "Music feels way too chill here. This is something I’d hear at a jazz bar or something." (after Jack is shot)
                    - "Honestly, I dont think the bg thing you have is working as well as it could. it causes weird frame drops. I wonder if having less rows but the cards way bigger would be better?"

